stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> blocked: task_create with open blocked_by (existing, visible tasks only)
    [*] --> pending: task_create, no open blocker
    blocked --> pending: last blocker completed
    blocked --> cancelled: a blocker failed, was cancelled or expired
    pending --> in_progress: task_claim by the assignee (or anyone if unassigned), owner set, generation + 1
    in_progress --> completed: task_update by owner at current generation, with result and call log
    in_progress --> failed: task_update by owner at current generation, with reason
    in_progress --> pending: task_release by owner, or hub after 10 min not ready; owner cleared, generation + 1
    pending --> cancelled: operator or creator cancels
    in_progress --> cancelled: operator cancels (shutdown)
    pending --> expired: lifetime reached
    blocked --> expired: lifetime reached
    in_progress --> expired: lifetime reached
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
